OL,3,GNEWSAMother urges people to join stem
OL,4,Acell register
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-three who was diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith a rare cancer 28 years to the day
OL,8,Fshe found out her son had leukaemia has
OL,9,Furged people to join the stem cell
OL,10,Fdonor register.
OL,12,FNikola Dolphin-Rowland, from
OL,13,FLeicestershire, was diagnosed with
OL,14,Facute myeloid leukaemia - a rare type
OL,15,Fof cancer that affects the blood and
OL,16,Fbone marrow - on 18 May.
OL,18,FThe 51-year-old - who has undergone
OL,19,Fthree rounds of chemotherapy - is due
OL,20,Fto have a stem cell transplant in the
OL,21,F"coming weeks" having found a match.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
